    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d443">

                <pb facs="0383" n="371" xml:id="pg371"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.20/561</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Harry A. McBride, Special Representative of
                        President Roosevelt in Liberia, to the President of Liberia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Barclay</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-03-21">March 21, 1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. President</hi>: In our recent
                    conversation I had the honor of informing you that in order to safeguard the
                    health of United States troops, the United States War Department requested the
                    cooperation of the Liberian health officials in a manner similar to that
                    existing in the United States between the Army authorities and the local Federal
                    and State agencies.</p>
                <p>The War Department requested that American Army medical authorities be given
                    health and sanitary control in all strictly defense areas which may be set-up
                    under our agreement, as well as in any contiguous areas which such medical
                    authorities might deem to present a health hazard to the United States troops.
                    It was my understanding that you are willing to grant these facilities in the
                    plans now being made for the defense and protection of the Republic.</p>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harry</hi> A. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >McBride</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
